     "role": "the count was set by filing before argument, and the wills offered as independent corroboration reach the reader in one text"
    },
    {
     "step": 6,
     "move": [
      "arg:a1658-ledger-finding"
     ],
     "role": "the one item outside the manuscripts attests one legal person, Aristotle"
    },
    {
     "step": 7,
     "move": [
      "arg:a123-pattern"
     ],
     "role": "configurations whose maker count can be inspected produce volume comparable to the combined corpus from one hand",
     "note": "#123's lifespan premise is bounded (lifespan_state); this step stands on the comparative cases"
