  {
   "@id": "claim:rv-ce-eternal",
   "@type": "Claim",
   "target": "site:ce-logos",
   "bodies": {
    "R": "principal"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "stmt:20261109-1248",
   "@type": "AuthorStatement",
   "date": "2026-11-09T12:48-05:00",
   "text": "rung vi does not depend on v. but v would of course strengthen vi if the entire material transmission and production chain could be shown to work by means of self-division"
  },
  {
   "@id": "stmt:20261109-1555",
   "@type": "AuthorStatement",
   "date": "2026-11-09T15:55-05:00",
   "text": "this is an argument about literature as literature, which is also always already theology. this language of 'christian tradition' is a super compressed inferential settlement colonizing the corpus of the nt... do we really have to do a whole reception history of how the nt became 'christian'?",
   "form": "excerpt: the message survives in this session as an excerpt with ellipses; the full message is the author's to seat"
  },
  {
   "@id": "stmt:20261109-1556",
   "@type": "AuthorStatement",
   "date": "2026-11-09T15:56-05:00",
   "text": "counterfeit orthodoxies. check that work."
  },
  {
   "@id": "stmt:20261109-1557",
   "@type": "AuthorStatement",
   "date": "2026-11-09T15:57-05:00",
   "text": "i also think the holographic frame needs to detail more of its method for establishing operational transmission... the philo one... construct it according to set transforms... foldings and unfoldings... doing *serious* literary historical methodological work",
   "form": "excerpt: the message survives in this session as an excerpt with ellipses; the full message is the author's to seat"
  },
  {
   "@id": "stmt:20261109-1558",
   "@type": "AuthorStatement",
   "date": "2026-11-09T15:58-05:00",
   "text": "the stylometric work, the vast censuses of work - this is literary methdology that is drawing on things that are newly possible at this scale in the age of ai"
  },
  {
   "@id": "stmt:20261109-1559",
   "@type": "AuthorStatement",
   "date": "2026-11-09T15:59-05:00",
   "text": "its bleeding edge shit"
  },
